From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:56:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! logging: structure block-file metadata and import
 diagnostics

Remove terminal per-producer JSON field/type/message conversion assertions. Preserve every preceding real RPC, file, restart, rejection and privacy assertion; remove now-unused schema reader helpers/imports only. No production code or lasting logging framework tests changed. Source syntax/Ruff/diff checks only; functional test NOT_RUN.

Preserved behavior: Empty and missing owned block-import files preserve the active chain.
---
 .../functional/feature_logging_block_files.py | 52 +------------------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 51 deletions(-)

diff --git a/test/functional/feature_logging_block_files.py b/test/functional/feature_logging_block_files.py
index 55ddbf47cf36d50d76c4933ea852ff1ddac40189..54715613685e5d6eb0a6e16f59356fd2872803ee 100644
--- a/test/functional/feature_logging_block_files.py
+++ b/test/functional/feature_logging_block_files.py
@@ -2,9 +2,7 @@
